1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,005
Now two characters at once.

2
00:00:02,005 --> 00:00:09,192
Round yellow seeds, R R Y Y, crossed with wrinkled green, r r y y.

3
00:00:09,192 --> 00:00:13,580
Every F one seed is round and yellow, R r Y y.

4
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:15,507
Here is the key step.

5
00:00:15,507 --> 00:00:26,588
Because the R pair separates independently of the Y pair, the F one makes four kinds of gamete, R Y, R y, r Y and r y, in equal numbers.

